{
    "chapter_num": 14,
    "verses_count": 40,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Prophecy and Tongues"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Pursue love, and desire spiritual "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "gifts,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " but especially that you may prophesy. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For he who speaks in a tongue does not speak to men but to God, for no one understands "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "him;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " however, in the spirit he speaks mysteries. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But he who prophesies speaks edification and exhortation and comfort to men. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "He who speaks in a tongue edifies himself, but he who prophesies edifies the church. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "I wish you all spoke with tongues, but even more that you prophesied; "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "for he who prophesies "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " greater than he who speaks with tongues, unless indeed he interprets, that the church may receive edification."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Tongues Must Be Interpreted"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But now, brethren, if I come to you speaking with tongues, what shall I profit you unless I speak to you either by revelation, by knowledge, by prophesying, or by teaching? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Even things without life, whether flute or harp, when they make a sound, unless they make a distinction in the sounds, how will it be known what is piped or played? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For if the trumpet makes an uncertain sound, who will prepare for battle? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So likewise you, unless you utter by the tongue words easy to understand, how will it be known what is spoken? For you will be speaking into the air. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "There are, it may be, so many kinds of languages in the world, and none of them "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " without "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "meaning"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "significance. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore, if I do not know the meaning of the language, I shall be a "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. barbarian"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "foreigner to him who speaks, and he who speaks "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "will be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a foreigner to me. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Even so you, since you are "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "eager"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "zealous for spiritual "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "gifts, let it be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " for the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "building up"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "edification of the church "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "that"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " you seek to excel."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore let him who speaks in a tongue pray that he may interpret. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For if I pray in a tongue, my spirit prays, but my understanding is unfruitful. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "What is "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "the conclusion"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " then? I will pray with the spirit, and I will also pray with the understanding. I will sing with the spirit, and I will also sing with the understanding. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Otherwise, if you bless with the spirit, how will he who occupies the place of the uninformed say “Amen” at your giving of thanks, since he does not understand what you say? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For you indeed give thanks well, but the other is not edified."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "I thank my God I speak with tongues more than you all; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "yet in the church I would rather speak five words with my understanding, that I may teach others also, than ten thousand words in a tongue."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Tongues a Sign to Unbelievers"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Brethren, do not be children in understanding; however, in malice be babes, but in understanding be mature."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "In the law it is written:"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“With"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "men of"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "other tongues and other lips"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "I will speak to this people;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "And yet, for all that, they will not hear Me,”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "says the Lord."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore tongues are for a sign, not to those who believe but to unbelievers; but prophesying is not for unbelievers but for those who believe. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore if the whole church comes together in one place, and all speak with tongues, and there come in "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "those who are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " uninformed or unbelievers, will they not say that you are "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "insane"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "out of your mind? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But if all prophesy, and an unbeliever or an uninformed person comes in, he is convinced by all, he is convicted by all. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits And thus"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And thus the secrets of his heart are revealed; and so, falling down on "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "his"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " face, he will worship God and report that God is truly among you."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Order in Church Meetings"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "How is it then, brethren? Whenever you come together, each of you has a psalm, has a teaching, has a tongue, has a revelation, has an interpretation. Let all things be done for "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "building up"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "edification. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 27,
                    "num_str": "27",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "If anyone speaks in a tongue, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "let there be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " two or at the most three, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "each"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in turn, and let one interpret. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 28,
                    "num_str": "28",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But if there is no interpreter, let him keep silent in church, and let him speak to himself and to God. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 29,
                    "num_str": "29",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Let two or three prophets speak, and let the others judge. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 30,
                    "num_str": "30",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But if "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "anything"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " is revealed to another who sits by, let the first keep silent. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 31,
                    "num_str": "31",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For you can all prophesy one by one, that all may learn and all may be encouraged. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 32,
                    "num_str": "32",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the spirits of the prophets are subject to the prophets. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 33,
                    "num_str": "33",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For God is not "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "the author"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "disorder"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "confusion but of peace, as in all the churches of the saints."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 34,
                    "num_str": "34",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Let "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits your"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "your women keep silent in the churches, for they are not permitted to speak; but "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "they are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to be submissive, as the law also says. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 35,
                    "num_str": "35",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And if they want to learn something, let them ask their own husbands at home; for it is shameful for women to speak in church."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 36,
                    "num_str": "36",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Or did the word of God come "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "originally"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " from you? Or "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " you only that it reached? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 37,
                    "num_str": "37",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "If anyone thinks himself to be a prophet or spiritual, let him acknowledge that the things which I write to you are the commandments of the Lord. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 38,
                    "num_str": "38",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU if anyone does not recognize this, he is not recognized."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "if anyone is ignorant, let him be ignorant."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 39,
                    "num_str": "39",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore, brethren, desire earnestly to prophesy, and do not forbid to speak with tongues. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 40,
                    "num_str": "40",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Let all things be done decently and in order."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}